  "_note": "Extraction schemas per document type (docs/04 M4, packages/ai). Each field: key (the model output key and the stg.extracted_value field), label (plain words for the review page), kind (date, money, percent, count), required, target (the mon.quarterly_performance column it promotes to, or null when it stays on the run), bounds (which unitSanityBoundsUsd range the converted dollar value is checked against, or null). Money values carry a unit among USD, USD_K, USD_M and USD_B and are converted to dollars by packages/calc toDollars at promotion; percent values are decimal fractions (0.4250 for 42.5%) with unit PCT; count values carry COUNT; date values carry DATE. highlights.bullets is the number of business highlight bullets the model writes; the openings and banned phrases come from config/style.json. A schema with no target on any field (capital_account_statement: our capital account, for one position when the document is linked to it and in a fund otherwise) is reviewed and approved like any other and promotes nothing to mon.quarterly_performance; with highlights.bullets 0 and commentary false the model writes no narrative.",
